---
source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Got it: reply with a short acknowledgement in your usual greeting and sign-off for that person. --dry-run prints the exact text

Usage: mxr messages ack [OPTIONS] <THREAD_ID>

Arguments:
  <THREAD_ID>  The conversation's thread id

Options:
      --dry-run            Print the exact text without sending it
      --account <ACCOUNT>  Limit to one account; the default covers every account
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
